  (132, 'Ethiopian mustard', 'Ethiopian mustard 
(Brassica carinata Braun) known us ''Gomenzer'' in Amharic, and the 
exotic rapeseed (Brassica napus). It is widely cultivated in the 
highland and semi-highland parts of the country with altitudes ranging 
from 1800-2600 m.a.s.l.; and it prefers low temperature with average 
